  "status": "Application Under Consideration",
  "description": "Proposed works to main building:\n\nRemoval of red stain to existing brickwork to front and side elevations. Brickwork to be stripped back to the London stock and repointed to match surrounding area.\n\nRemoval of existing PvC Casement windows to front elevation & replace with double glazed timber frame sash windows to match the properties adjacent. New windows to have period details and finishes to match the surrounding area. Historic plasterwork mouldings to window portico and cast iron pot guards to raised ground floor and first floor to be re-instated.\n\nRemoval of existing casement windows to rear elevation & replacement of existing single glazed sash windows with new timber framed double glazed sash windows. Stained glass elements to be carefully removed and integrated into new windows to maintain existing character.\n\nRemoval of existing slate dormer extension to rear and side elevation. New dormers to sit within the existing roof frame. New dormers to have Timber framed double glazed windows with lead cladding to new dormer to match surrounding properties.\n\nNew sklight to front pitch of roof.\n\nExisting staircase to loft to be reconfigured to allow for access with new location of dormers. New WC to top floor. New soil pipe to rear elevation to tap into existing Soil pipe to rear elevation.\n\nProposed works to Garden:\n\nRemove the existing shed to rear of garden.\n\nConstruct a timber frame insulated garden room office and sauna to rear of garden. New structure to have charred timber horizontal rainscreen with an EPDM flat roof with Seedum green roof over. Aluminium Windows and doors to be powder coated anthracite to match cladding and existing sliding doors to ground floor of the main house.",
